+# Activities
+
+Activities represent account timeline events across boards you have access to, such as card creations, assignments, board moves, title changes, column triage, closures, and comments.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activities you have access to, ordered newest first. Results can be filtered using query parameters.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq9",
+    "action": "card_title_changed",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:40:00.000Z",
+    "description": "David renamed \"New Title\" (was: \"Old Title\")",
+    "particulars": {
+      "old_title": "Old Title",
+      "new_title": "New Title"
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "New Title",
+      "status": "published",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
